      "category": "COMBINED",
      "subsection": "General",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed many Hold powers that were incorrectly causing targets to use the ‘disoriented’ animation, including Cinder, Block of Ice, Strangler, Fossilize, and Freezing Touch."
    },
    {
      "category": "COMBINED",
      "subsection": "General",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Shield Defense – Fixed a bug that caused some falling animations to loop with a shield out."
    },
    {
      "category": "COMBINED",
      "subsection": "PvP",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Ninja Run (available through the Martial Arts Pack) - Corrected PvP suppression speed and height values for the Ninja Run power. They were set equivalent to Super Jump, instead of the proper values."
    },
